CRITICAL BUG RESOLUTION 1: SG-001 (Patient Appointment Cancellation)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
File:     src/services/appointmentService.js & src/features/patient/MyAppointments.jsx
Problem:  Clicking "Cancel Appointment" caused an unhandled TypeError because
          appointmentService.cancel was missing.
Fix:      Implemented appointmentService.cancel(id, reason, userId) wrapping
          updateStatus(id, 'CANCELLED', reason, userId) with full audit logging.
Status:   VERIFIED & RESOLVED
================================================================================
================================================================================
CRITICAL BUG RESOLUTION 2: SG-002 (Reschedule Method Signature Mismatch)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
File:     src/services/appointmentService.js & src/features/patient/MyAppointments.jsx
Problem:  Rescheduling called the service with 5 parameters while the function only
          accepted 4, corrupting userId and dropping dentist updates.
Fix:      Overloaded appointmentService.reschedule(id, newDate, newSlot, dentistId, userId)
          to dynamically adapt, verify dentist slot conflicts, and update records.
Status:   VERIFIED & RESOLVED
